    'courier_ordering_summary' => 'Pick a courier when you order, or let the company decide. Then follow the parcel on the order page.',
    'courier_ordering_purpose' => 'The order form has a “Courier” box. It lists the couriers the owner has switched on, and “Company decides”.',
    'courier_ordering_why' => 'You can pick the courier that works well in your area. You can see where your parcel is without calling anyone.',
    'courier_ordering_s1' => 'Open “New order” and make your order as usual.',
    'courier_ordering_s2' => 'In the “Courier” box, pick a courier. If any courier is fine, leave it on “Company decides”.',
    'courier_ordering_s3' => 'If you picked a courier, the parcel is booked with that courier by itself once your order is approved.',
    'courier_ordering_s4' => 'If you leave “Company decides”, the office chooses the courier and sends the parcel.',
    'courier_ordering_s5' => 'Open the order and look at “Parcel tracking”. The steps are: Waiting for pickup, Picked up, On the way, Delivery. A parcel sent back shows “Returned”.',
    'courier_ordering_s6' => 'Press “Copy” to copy the tracking number. Press “Track on the courier website” to open the courier’s own page.',
    'courier_ordering_s7' => 'If the office changes your courier, you get a notice. The order page shows the change and any note from the office.',
    'courier_ordering_o1' => 'You know which courier has your parcel and what the tracking number is.',
    'courier_ordering_o2' => 'You get a notice on the bell each time the parcel moves to a new step.',
    'courier_ordering_t1' => 'The system asks the courier for news every 30 minutes. It also asks when you open the order page.',
    'courier_ordering_t2' => 'Give the tracking number to the person who will receive the parcel.',
    'courier_ordering_w1' => 'Even when the courier says “Delivered”, the order is not finished. The office must confirm the delivery first. Commission comes only after that.',
    'courier_staff_badge' => 'Courier',
    'courier_staff_title' => 'Automatic booking and changing the courier',
    'courier_staff_summary' => 'When a dealer picks a courier, the parcel is booked by itself on approval. You can change the courier if needed.',
    'courier_staff_purpose' => 'When a dealer picks a courier, you do not send the parcel by hand. An order marked “Company decides” is still sent by you, as before.',
    'courier_staff_why' => 'Automatic booking means less typing. The dealer gets the tracking number sooner.',
    'deliveries_board_badge' => 'Deliveries',
    'deliveries_board_title' => 'The Deliveries page',
    'deliveries_board_summary' => 'On the “Deliveries” page, see which orders are waiting to be sent, which parcels are with a courier, and which bookings failed.',
    'deliveries_board_purpose' => 'This page shows orders waiting to be sent, parcels with a courier, and bookings that did not happen. You can fix a failed booking from here.',
    'deliveries_board_why' => 'If a booking failed, the parcel has not left. This page keeps those orders in front of you.',
    'notification_panel_badge' => 'Notices',
    'notification_panel_title' => 'The bell and notice panel',
    'notification_panel_summary' => 'Press the bell at the top of any page to read new notices.',
    'notification_panel_purpose' => 'When you press the bell, you see your 15 newest notices. The number on the bell tells you how many are still unread.',
    'notification_panel_why' => 'You can see order, money and company news without leaving your page.',
    'notification_panel_s1' => 'Look at the bell in the top bar. If it has a number, you have unread notices.',
    'notification_panel_s2' => 'Press the bell. On a computer, a small panel opens. On a phone, it fills the screen.',
    'notification_panel_s3' => 'Press a notice to open it. It then counts as read.',
    'notification_panel_s4' => 'To mark all notices as read at once, press “Mark all as read”.',
    'notification_panel_s5' => 'To see the full list, press “See all notifications” at the bottom.',
    'notification_panel_s6' => 'To close the panel, press X or press outside it.',
    'notification_panel_o1' => 'The number on the bell goes down as you read.',
    'notification_panel_t1' => 'Order news, money news and support replies all come here.',
    'notification_panel_w1' => 'Never give your password or a code to anyone, even if a message asks for it.',
    'branch_switcher_badge' => 'Branch',
    'branch_switcher_title' => 'Change branch from the top bar',
    'branch_switcher_summary' => 'Choose a branch in the top bar and the pages show only that branch’s information.',
    'branch_switcher_purpose' => 'Office staff and the owner have a list of branches in the top bar. Dealers and sub-dealers do not have it.',
    'branch_switcher_why' => 'You can look at one branch’s work without mixing in other branches.',
    'branch_switcher_s1' => 'Press the branch name in the top bar. On a phone it sits under the page name.',
    'branch_switcher_s2' => 'The owner, and staff who work on accounts, stock or money, can see all branches. They can also choose “All branches”.',
    'branch_switcher_s3' => 'Other staff see only their own branches. They do not get “All branches”.',
    'branch_switcher_s4' => 'A staff member with no branch does not get the list. Branch pages stay empty until the owner gives them a branch.',
    'branch_switcher_s5' => 'Choose one branch. Then the dashboard, orders, deliveries, withdrawal requests, reports, top sellers, and the dealer, sub-dealer and staff lists show that branch’s information. New orders, dealers and sub-dealers that have no branch yet show under Head office.',
    'branch_switcher_s6' => 'The page tells you which branch you are looking at. For example: “Showing: Head office”.',
    'branch_switcher_o1' => 'You see the figures of one branch at a time.',
    'branch_switcher_t1' => 'Check the branch name before you write anything about stock or a branch.',
    'branch_switcher_w1' => 'Staff cannot open a branch that is not theirs, even by typing the address.',
    'website_button_badge' => 'Website',
    'website_button_title' => 'The “Visit website” button',
    'website_button_summary' => 'Press the globe button in the top bar to open the company’s public website.',
    'website_button_purpose' => 'With one press you can go from the panel to the company’s website.',
    'website_button_why' => 'You can see the products and company details the same way customers see them.',
    'website_button_s1' => 'Press the globe in the top bar. It is called “Visit website”.',
    'website_button_s2' => 'The company’s website opens in the same browser tab.',
    'website_button_s3' => 'To come back, press your browser’s back button.',
    'website_button_s4' => 'The same link is also in your picture menu.',
    'website_button_o1' => 'You see the website the way customers see it.',
    'website_button_t1' => 'To keep the panel open, open the website in a new browser tab.',
    'website_button_w1' => 'Going to the website does not log you out. When you finish on someone else’s computer, log out.',
    'prescriptions_partner_badge' => 'Prescription',
    'prescriptions_partner_title' => 'Prescriptions for dealers and sub-dealers',
    'prescriptions_partner_summary' => 'Once your registration is checked, you can keep patient records and write prescriptions.',
    'prescriptions_partner_purpose' => 'At first, prescriptions are off for everyone. When the office checks your registration and turns it on, “Prescription” appears in your menu.',
    'prescriptions_partner_why' => 'A prescription is a medical paper. So only people with a checked registration write them.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s1' => 'Show your registration paper to the office. It can be from BMDC, the Unani board or the Ayurvedic board.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s2' => 'When the office turns it on, open “Prescription” from the menu.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s3' => 'In “New prescription”, first choose the patient. For a returning patient, press “Old patient”. You can type a name in the box above the list to search.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s4' => 'For a new patient, press “New patient”. Type the name and other details, tick the consent box, then press “Continue”. The patient details are saved together with the prescription.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s5' => 'Choose each medicine from the company list. Then type the dose, how many times a day and for how many days. Add the price, quantity and discount if you have them. In the box below, you can write tests, food advice and other advice.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s6' => 'To add another medicine, press “Add medicine”. Check everything, then press “Save prescription”.',
    'prescriptions_partner_s7' => 'To print, press “Print (Bangla)” or “Print (English)”.',
    'prescriptions_partner_o1' => 'Only you can see your patients and prescriptions. The owner cannot see them either.',
    'prescriptions_partner_o2' => 'The total is worked out from the price, quantity and discount you enter.',
    'prescriptions_partner_t1' => 'One prescription can hold up to 30 medicines. Your registration number is printed on the prescription.',
    'prescriptions_partner_t2' => 'The “My report” tab shows the price totals of the prescriptions you wrote.',
    'prescriptions_partner_w1' => 'These medicines are not taken out of the company stock. They are not company orders, so there is no commission.',
    'prescriptions_verify_badge' => 'Turning prescriptions on',
    'prescriptions_verify_title' => 'Turning on prescriptions for a dealer or sub-dealer',
    'prescriptions_verify_summary' => 'The owner, or staff who have permission, check the registration and turn prescriptions on.',
    'prescriptions_verify_purpose' => 'Prescriptions are off for everyone at first. They stay off until someone sees the registration paper and turns them on.',
    'prescriptions_verify_why' => 'Only people with a real registration should write prescriptions. Every change is written in the “Work log”.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s1' => 'See the partner\'s registration paper yourself.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s2' => 'In the “Dealer” or “Sub-dealer” list, find the partner and press “Edit / status”.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s3' => 'In the “Prescription” part, choose the registration type: BMDC, Unani board or Ayurvedic board.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s4' => 'Type the registration number. Add a note if you wish. Then press “Turn on prescriptions”.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s5' => 'After this, the partner sees “Prescription” in their menu.',
    'prescriptions_verify_s6' => 'To turn it off, write the reason, then press “Close”.',
    'prescriptions_verify_o1' => 'This part shows who turned it on or off, and when.',
    'prescriptions_verify_t1' => 'Owner: to give this job to a staff member, give them the “Verify prescribers” permission on the “Staff list” page.',
    'prescriptions_verify_w1' => 'Turn it on only after you have seen the registration paper yourself.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_badge' => 'Chamber',
    'clinic_prescriptions_title' => 'The owner\'s chamber prescriptions',
    'clinic_prescriptions_summary' => 'Write prescriptions with company products and give the medicine from a branch.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_purpose' => 'When you give the medicine, the stock of the branch you choose goes down. The money is split into two funds: the manufacturer fund and the chamber fund.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_why' => 'Each prescription shows the two shares separately, so the accounts stay clear.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s1' => 'Open “Prescription” from the menu. On the Super Admin login, this page is always there.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s2' => 'The first time, open the “Settings” tab and save your registration type and number. They are printed on your prescriptions.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s3' => 'In “New prescription”, first choose the patient. For a returning patient, press “Old patient”. For a new one, press “New patient”, write the details, then press “Continue”.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s4' => 'On each line, choose a company product. The name and MRP come from the product. Then type your price, quantity and discount.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s5' => 'Press “Save prescription”. The status will show “Written”.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s6' => 'In the list, choose a branch and press “Dispense”, then confirm. That branch\'s stock goes down and the status shows “Dispensed”.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s7' => 'To see sales and both funds for any dates, open the “Clinic report” tab.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_o1' => '30% of each product\'s MRP goes to the manufacturer fund.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_o2' => 'The rest of your price goes to the chamber fund.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_o3' => 'No dealer order is made, and there is no dealer commission.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_t1' => 'Example: the MRP is ৳100 and your price is ৳70. Then ৳30 goes to the manufacturer fund and ৳40 goes to the chamber fund.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_t2' => 'Each doctor sees only their own patients and prescriptions. You cannot see any partner\'s patients.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_w1' => 'If the price is below 30% of MRP, the system asks you to confirm, because the company loses money. Other office accounts cannot sell that low.',
    'tour_bell_title' => 'Notifications',
    'tour_bell_loc' => 'The bell in the top bar',
    'tour_bell_body' => 'The bell opens your 15 newest notices. A number on it means some are unread.',
    'tour_bell_action' => 'Press the bell. Press a notice to open it, or press “Mark all as read”.',
    'tour_bell_tip' => 'Press “See all notifications” at the bottom for the full list.',
    'tour_website_title' => 'Visit website',
    'tour_website_loc' => 'The globe in the top bar',
    'tour_website_body' => 'The globe opens the company\'s website in the same tab.',
    'tour_website_action' => 'Press the globe. To come back, press your browser\'s back button.',
    'tour_website_tip' => 'The same link is in the menu under your photo.',
    'tour_branch_title' => 'Changing branch',
    'tour_branch_loc' => 'Top bar (on a phone, under the page title)',
