    'tour_branch_action' => 'Press the branch name and choose one.',
    'tour_branch_tip' => 'The page tells you which branch you are looking at.',
    'tour_partner_courier_title' => 'Courier and parcel tracking',
    'tour_partner_courier_loc' => 'The order form and the order page',
    'tour_partner_courier_body' => 'When you order, pick a courier or keep “Company decides”. After approval the parcel is booked, and the order page shows the tracking number and where the parcel is.',
    'tour_partner_courier_action' => 'Press an order to see its parcel. Press “Copy” to copy the tracking number.',
    'tour_partner_courier_tip' => 'You get a bell notice each time the parcel moves to a new step.',
    'tour_office_courier_title' => 'Courier booking',
    'tour_office_courier_loc' => 'Menu → Deliveries',
    'tour_office_courier_body' => 'If the dealer picked a courier, the parcel is booked by itself when the order is approved. If the courier refuses it, the order shows under “Failed bookings” on the Deliveries page.',
    'tour_office_courier_action' => 'Open the order to try booking again, or change the courier and add a note for the dealer.',
    'tour_office_courier_tip' => 'The courier saying “Delivered” does not finish the order. Staff must still confirm the delivery.',
    'tour_partner_rx_title' => 'Prescriptions',
    'tour_partner_rx_loc' => 'Menu → Prescriptions',
    'tour_partner_rx_body' => 'Prescriptions are on for your account. Choose an old or new patient, then type each medicine with its price and discount. Nothing comes from company stock.',
    'tour_partner_rx_action' => 'Open “Prescriptions” and fill in “New prescription”.',
    'tour_partner_rx_tip' => 'You can print a prescription in Bangla or English.',
    'tour_owner_rx_title' => 'Clinic prescriptions',
    'tour_owner_rx_loc' => 'Menu → Prescriptions',
    'tour_owner_rx_body' => 'Write a prescription from company products, pick a branch and press “Dispense”. Stock leaves that branch, and 30% of MRP goes to the manufacturer fund and the rest to the clinic fund.',
    'tour_owner_rx_action' => 'Open “Prescriptions” and fill in “New prescription”.',
    'tour_owner_rx_tip' => 'The “Clinic report” tab shows the totals for any dates.',
    'menu_office_badge' => 'Office menu',
    'menu_office_title' => 'Where each page is in the office menu',
    'menu_office_summary' => 'In the left menu, daily work is at the top and rarely used pages are below.',
    'menu_office_purpose' => 'This tells you which menu row holds which page.',
    'menu_office_why' => 'When you know where a page is, you do not lose time looking for it.',
    'menu_partner_badge' => 'Your menu',
    'menu_partner_title' => 'Where each page is in your menu',
    'menu_partner_summary' => 'The menu starts with daily work. This chapter says where each page is.',
    'menu_partner_purpose' => 'It lists which page is where for dealers and sub-dealers.',
    'menu_partner_why' => 'When you know where a page is, you do not need to phone the office.',
    'commission_tabs_badge' => 'Commission page',
    'commission_tabs_title' => 'Commission rules and rates: one page, four tabs',
    'commission_tabs_summary' => 'All commission settings are now four tabs on one page.',
    'commission_tabs_purpose' => 'Open “Other modules” in the menu, then press the “Commission rules & rates” box. The owner and staff allowed to handle accounts see this page.',
    'commission_tabs_why' => 'You do not have to hunt for each setting in the menu.',
    'commission_tabs_s1' => 'Open “Other modules” from the menu, then press the “Commission rules & rates” box.',
    'commission_tabs_s2' => 'On “Set commission shares”, see how each sale\'s money is divided.',
    'commission_tabs_s3' => 'On “Written commission rules”, see the rules by which partners earn commission.',
    'commission_tabs_s4' => 'On “Special rate for one partner”, give one partner a different rate.',
    'commission_tabs_s5' => 'On “Commission calculator”, try a sale and see who would get what.',
    'commission_tabs_o1' => 'One tap takes you from one setting to another.',
    'commission_tabs_t1' => 'Try any change in the calculator first. No money moves there.',
    'commission_tabs_w1' => 'Do not change a rate without written approval and a start date.',
    'report_centre_badge' => 'Report files',
    'report_centre_title' => 'Download report files',
    'report_centre_summary' => 'Pick the dates and download a report file.',
    'report_centre_purpose' => 'Report files are under the “Download” button on the “Order report” tab of “Treasury”. You see only the files your job allows.',
    'report_centre_why' => 'With all files in one place, you do not have to remember which page holds which file.',
    'report_centre_s1' => 'Open “Treasury” from the menu and choose “Order report”. Open “Reports”, then “Report files (Excel)”, for every Excel and PDF file you may download.',
    'report_centre_s2' => 'Pick the dates from the list.',
    'report_centre_s3' => 'Press “Download” and choose the file you want.',
    'report_centre_o1' => 'You get the file for the dates you picked.',
    'report_centre_t1' => 'Top sellers and branch sales are also in the “Reports” menu.',
    'report_centre_w1' => 'Only staff allowed to see all branches get the files for the whole company.',
    'my_money_tabs_badge' => 'Wallet',
    'my_money_tabs_title' => '“Wallet”: all your money on one page',
    'my_money_tabs_summary' => 'How much you have, where it came from, and how much went out.',
    'my_money_tabs_purpose' => 'Press “Wallet” in the menu. A wallet is the record of your money. You do not need to look through separate pages.',
    'my_money_tabs_why' => 'One page and one list make your money easy to check.',
    'support_one_form_badge' => 'Help request',
    'support_one_form_title' => 'Asking the office for help: one form',
    'support_one_form_summary' => 'There is one form for orders, NID corrections, payments or any other help.',
    'support_one_form_purpose' => 'The separate forms are gone. Use the help request form. Read the office’s reply there too.',
    'support_one_form_why' => 'Your question and the answer stay together, so nothing gets lost.',
    'support_one_form_s1' => 'Open “Contact the office”, then “Help”.',
    'support_one_form_s2' => 'Press “Send a help request”.',
    'support_one_form_s3' => 'Choose the topic. Write a title and the details. You can add a photo or PDF.',
    'support_one_form_s4' => 'Below the form is the list of your requests. To read the office’s reply, press “See details”.',
    'support_one_form_o1' => 'All your requests and replies are in one list.',
    'support_one_form_t1' => 'Use messages for small questions. Use this form for anything that needs a record.',
    'support_one_form_w1' => 'Do not write a password or a full NID number in a request.',
    'website_editor_badge' => 'Arrange the website',
    'website_editor_title' => 'Changing the website text, pictures and videos',
    'website_editor_summary' => 'You can change everything on the website in five parts. There is a search box and a save bar that is always in view.',
    'website_editor_purpose' => 'All the text, pictures and videos of the website are changed on this page.',
    'website_editor_why' => 'You find the box you need quickly. You can also see whether your change is saved.',
    'stock_batches_badge' => 'Batches & expiry',
    'stock_batches_title' => 'Batch numbers and expiry dates',
    'stock_batches_summary' => 'Keep the batch and expiry of your goods. Goods that expire first go out first.',
    'stock_batches_purpose' => 'A batch is a group of goods that came together. The batch number printed on the pack identifies it. Write the batch number when goods arrive. Then the system picks the right batch by itself.',
    'stock_batches_why' => 'Older goods are sold before they expire. You can also see which batch went to whom.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_badge' => 'Recall & transfers',
    'stock_recall_transfers_title' => 'Batch recall, sending goods between branches, and the reorder list',
    'stock_recall_transfers_summary' => 'See who received a batch. Send goods to another branch. See what to buy again.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_purpose' => 'The “Batches & expiry” page has three tabs for this: “Batch recall”, “Branch transfers” and “Reorder list”. A recall means asking for a batch to be returned.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_why' => 'If a batch has a problem, you know at once who received it. The goods that move between branches are also recorded.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_s1' => 'In the “Batch recall” tab, write the batch number and press “Find who received it”. It shows the orders, partners and clinic sales it went to, and how much is still in stock.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_s2' => 'In the “Branch transfers” tab, fill in “New transfer request” and press “Request transfer”.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_s3' => 'When the goods leave, press “Send”. They come out of your branch stock and show as “On the way”.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_s4' => 'When the goods arrive, the other branch presses “Receive”. Then the goods are added to their stock.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_s5' => 'In the “Reorder list” tab, see which products are running low. It also suggests how much to buy.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_o1' => 'The stock of each branch matches what really moved.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_t1' => 'You can cancel a transfer until the goods are sent.',
    'stock_recall_transfers_w1' => 'A recall only shows a list. The system does not tell anyone. You must phone the partners yourself.',
    'purchasing_goods_badge' => 'Purchases',
    'purchasing_goods_title' => 'Purchases: suppliers, orders and receiving goods',
    'purchasing_goods_summary' => 'Keep a list of suppliers. Place orders. Add goods to stock when they arrive.',
    'purchasing_goods_purpose' => 'The “Purchases” page in the “Products & stock” menu has two tabs: “Purchase orders” and “Suppliers”. A supplier is a person or firm you buy goods from.',
    'purchasing_goods_why' => 'You can see in one place how much you ordered, how much came, and how much is still due.',
    'stock_counting_badge' => 'Stock counts',
    'stock_counting_title' => 'Stock count: matching the shelf with the system',
    'stock_counting_summary' => 'Count what is on the shelf. Match it with the system. Send it for approval.',
    'stock_counting_purpose' => 'You do this on the “Stock counts” page in the “Products & stock” menu. A difference is the gap between what you counted and what the system says. Stock changes only after the count is approved, and only by the difference.',
    'stock_counting_why' => 'If you count regularly, missing or extra goods are found early.',
    'parcel_received_back_badge' => 'Returned parcel',
    'parcel_received_back_title' => 'When the courier returns a parcel',
    'parcel_received_back_summary' => 'When the parcel is back at the branch, press “Parcel received back”. The goods go back into stock.',
    'parcel_received_back_purpose' => 'A parcel the courier returned cannot be confirmed as delivered. Use this button to close it properly.',
    'parcel_received_back_why' => 'If you do not press it, the goods stay out of stock and the order stays open.',
    'mixed_delivery_decision_badge' => 'Partly delivered',
    'mixed_delivery_decision_title' => 'One parcel arrived, another came back',
    'mixed_delivery_decision_summary' => 'Commission is paid only on what arrived. What came back goes into stock again.',
    'mixed_delivery_decision_purpose' => 'When some parcels of an order arrive and others come back, the order becomes “Partly delivered”. For almost every order, commission is added by itself.',
    'mixed_delivery_decision_why' => 'Every time, commission is paid only on the goods that really arrived.',
    'manual_couriers_badge' => 'Manual couriers',
    'manual_couriers_title' => 'Couriers with no automatic booking',
    'manual_couriers_summary' => 'With Sundarban, SA Paribahan, Karatoa, Janani and Continental, you send the parcel and change its step yourself.',
    'manual_couriers_purpose' => 'These couriers are not connected to the system. So you send the parcel and change its step by hand.',
    'manual_couriers_why' => 'If you keep the step up to date, the dealer can follow the parcel.',
    'global_search_badge' => 'Search',
    'global_search_title' => 'Search from the top bar',
    'global_search_summary' => 'Find an order, partner or product from any page.',
    'global_search_purpose' => 'The “Search” button is in the top bar. It also opens when you press Ctrl+K on the keyboard.',
    'global_search_why' => 'You can open what you need without going through the menu.',
    'global_search_s1' => 'Press “Search” in the top bar, or press Ctrl+K.',
    'global_search_s2' => 'Type at least 2 letters or numbers. You can type an order number, name, code, phone or SKU.',
    'global_search_s3' => 'Results come in three groups: orders, partners and products. Press the one you need.',
    'global_search_o1' => 'In a few seconds you reach the right order or partner page.',
    'global_search_t1' => 'If nothing comes up, check the spelling or type less.',
    'global_search_w1' => 'You see only what your permission and branch allow. Phone numbers are always partly hidden.',
    'company_funds_heads_badge' => 'Spending heads',
    'company_funds_heads_title' => 'Spending from funds, heads and budgets',
    'company_funds_heads_summary' => 'Every spend has a head. You get a warning when a budget is passed.',
    'company_funds_heads_purpose' => 'Spending heads and monthly budgets are set on the “Spending, budgets & pending work” tab of “Treasury”.',
    'company_funds_heads_why' => 'Named heads show where the company money is going.',
    'company_funds_heads_s1' => 'To spend, open a fund in “Treasury” and press “Spend”. Pick a head.',
    'company_funds_heads_s2' => 'The spend goes to the “Waiting” list on “Spending, budgets & pending work”. Another staff member with approval permission approves it. A spend at or above the owner\'s limit (৳1,00,000 at the start) is approved only by the owner. The owner can do it alone.',
    'company_funds_heads_s3' => 'To add or change a head, open the “Spending heads” tab in “Spending, budgets & pending work”.',
    'company_funds_heads_s4' => 'To give a monthly budget, open the “Budgets” tab and press “Set a budget”.',
    'company_funds_heads_o1' => 'You can see spending by head and by month.',
    'company_funds_heads_t1' => 'A budget only warns you. It does not stop a spend.',
    'company_funds_heads_w1' => 'Before you spend, check how much is in the fund now.',
    'accounting_statements_badge' => 'Accountant\'s files',
    'accounting_statements_title' => 'Accountant\'s files',
    'accounting_statements_summary' => 'Download profit and loss, balance sheet and trial balance as files.',
    'accounting_statements_purpose' => 'A balance sheet shows what the company has and what it owes. A trial balance shows the total of every account. All three files are under the “Download” button on “Order report”.',
    'accounting_statements_why' => 'Your accountant gets the same figures as the system.',
    'statement_matching_badge' => 'Statement check',
    'statement_matching_title' => 'Match a bank, bKash or Nagad statement',
    'statement_matching_summary' => 'Upload a statement and the system shows which payment claims match.',
    'statement_matching_purpose' => 'Matching every line of a bank or bKash statement by eye takes long. The system finds the matches. You make the decision.',
    'statement_matching_why' => 'The eye misses a reference used twice or an amount that differs. The system points them out.',
    'statement_matching_s1' => 'Open “Treasury”, go to the “Spending, budgets & pending work” tab and press “Bank check”.',
    'statement_matching_s2' => 'Choose where the statement is from and give it a name. Pick a CSV or Excel file and press “Upload statement”.',
    'statement_matching_s3' => 'Say which column holds the reference and which holds the money received. Pick the row where payments start and press “Find matches”.',
    'statement_matching_s4' => 'Read the result of each line: “Match suggested”, “Same reference, different amount”, “No pending claim” or “Skipped”.',
    'statement_matching_s5' => 'If it is right, press “Confirm match”. If not, press “Turn down”. On a line marked “Possibly fake”, write what you checked.',
    'statement_matching_s6' => 'Last, go to “Check order payments” and approve the payment.',
    'statement_matching_o1' => 'You can see which claims match the statement and which do not.',
    'statement_matching_t1' => 'The same file cannot be uploaded twice.',
    'statement_matching_w1' => 'The system never approves a payment. “Confirm match” only records that you looked at the line.',
    'payout_file_badge' => 'Bank file',
    'payout_file_title' => 'File for the bank',
    'payout_file_summary' => 'One file of all withdrawals that are approved but not yet sent.',
    'payout_file_purpose' => 'The button is on the “Withdrawal requests” page. It helps when you send money to many partners at once.',
    'payout_file_why' => 'Paying from one file means less typing and fewer mistakes.',
    'payout_file_s1' => 'Open “Withdrawal requests” from the menu.',
    'payout_file_s2' => 'Press “Download bank file”. Use the file at the bank or in bKash.',
    'payout_file_s3' => 'After sending the money, press “Record payment” for each payment. Add the transaction number and the receipt.',
    'payout_file_o1' => 'The file lists only withdrawals that are approved and not yet sent.',
    'payout_file_t1' => 'Download the file just before you send the money. Then the figures are fresh.',
    'payout_file_w1' => 'The file does not pay anyone by itself. Record every payment after you send it.',
    'repeat_order_badge' => 'Order again',
    'repeat_order_title' => 'Ordering the same goods again',
    'repeat_order_summary' => 'One press puts a past order in your cart, with today’s prices and stock.',
    'repeat_order_purpose' => 'The “Order again” box is on the “New order” page.',
    'repeat_order_why' => 'You do not have to find and pick the same products one by one.',
    'repeat_order_s1' => 'Open “New order” and find the “Order again” box.',
    'repeat_order_s2' => 'Next to “Last order” or “Earlier order”, press “Put in cart”.',
    'repeat_order_s3' => 'The page tells you if a price changed, if a quantity went down, or if an item cannot be ordered today.',
    'repeat_order_s4' => 'Check the items and prices. Then pay in full and send the order, as usual.',
    'repeat_order_o1' => 'Your cart is ready in one press.',
    'repeat_order_t1' => 'Items that are no longer sold or are out of stock are left out by themselves.',
    'repeat_order_w1' => 'This only fills the cart. Nothing is ordered until you finish the order and pay.',
    'alerts_next_steps_badge' => 'Alerts & next steps',
    'alerts_next_steps_title' => 'Alerts and next steps on your Dashboard',
    'alerts_next_steps_summary' => 'Two boxes tell you what needs your attention and what to do next.',
    'alerts_next_steps_purpose' => 'The boxes use the same figures as the month-end close.',
    'alerts_next_steps_why' => 'You find out while there is still time in the month, so you can put things right.',
    'alerts_next_steps_s1' => 'Dealers: the “You need to look at this” box shows if your salary target or your rank purchase is at risk this month. It also shows how close you are to the next rank.',
    'alerts_next_steps_s2' => 'If your direct partners have not ordered for a long time, the same box lists them under “Give them a call”.',
    'alerts_next_steps_s3' => 'The “Your next steps” box says how much more to buy, or how many team leaders you still need.',
    'alerts_next_steps_s4' => 'The same alerts also come as notices under the bell.',
    'alerts_next_steps_o1' => 'You know what to do before the month ends.',
    'alerts_next_steps_t1' => 'Press an alert to open the matching page.',
    'alerts_next_steps_w1' => 'These boxes show purchases and team only. They do not say how much you will earn. They are not a promise of any income.',
    'sales_kit_partner_badge' => 'Sales kit',
    'sales_kit_partner_title' => 'Sales kit: files the company has approved',
    'sales_kit_partner_summary' => 'Posters, price lists and social posts you can share.',
    'sales_kit_partner_purpose' => 'The company keeps approved files here. So everyone shares the same correct file.',
    'sales_kit_partner_why' => 'What you share stays correct and matches what the company has approved.',
    'sales_kit_partner_s1' => 'Open “Other modules” from the menu, then “Sales kit”.',
    'sales_kit_partner_s2' => 'If you want, choose a “Type” or a “Language”.',
    'sales_kit_partner_s3' => 'Press “View” to look at a file. Press “Download” to save it on your phone.',
    'sales_kit_partner_o1' => 'You always have the approved version.',
    'sales_kit_partner_t1' => 'Only the owner can add, change or remove files.',
    'sales_kit_partner_w1' => 'Do not change a file. Do not add claims about curing illness or earning money.',
    'sales_kit_schemes_owner_badge' => 'Sales kit & schemes',
    'sales_kit_schemes_owner_title' => 'Owner: adding sales kit files and schemes',
    'sales_kit_schemes_owner_summary' => 'Upload the files partners can share. Tell them about the current schemes.',
    'sales_kit_schemes_owner_purpose' => 'The “Sales kit” and “Schemes” pages in the “For partners” menu open only for the owner. The sales kit holds files such as posters and price lists. A scheme is an offer for a limited time.',
    'sales_kit_schemes_owner_why' => 'Partners get one right place for files and offers.',
    'customer_book_badge' => 'My customers',
    'customer_book_title' => 'My customers: your own customer book',
    'customer_book_summary' => 'Keep your own customers, notes and follow-up dates.',
    'customer_book_purpose' => 'Open “Customers” under “My team & customers” in the menu. For sub-dealers the row is called “My customers”.',
    'customer_book_why' => 'You remember who to call and when.',
    'customer_book_s1' => 'Type the name, mobile number, notes and “Follow-up date”. Then press “Save”.',
    'customer_book_s2' => 'Type a name in “Search”. Or choose “Due or late only”. This shows who you need to call.',
    'customer_book_s3' => 'After you call, press “Follow-up done”.',
    'customer_book_s4' => 'Press “Edit” to change a customer’s details. Press “Delete” to remove one.',
    'customer_book_o1' => 'A notice on the portal each day tells you how many follow-ups are due or late.',
    'customer_book_t1' => 'Keep notes short, so they are quick to read before a call.',
    'customer_book_w1' => 'This book is yours alone. The office and the owner cannot see it. A deleted customer cannot be brought back.',
    'schemes_partner_badge' => 'Schemes',
    'schemes_partner_title' => 'Schemes: offers while you order',
    'schemes_partner_summary' => 'Running schemes show on the “New order” page.',
    'schemes_partner_purpose' => 'A scheme is an offer from the company. You see it while you order.',
    'schemes_partner_why' => 'You know about an offer before you decide how much to buy.',
    'schemes_partner_s1' => 'Open “New order” and look at “Schemes running now”.',
    'schemes_partner_s2' => 'Keep adding products to the cart. The page tells you if you have reached the scheme’s minimum. If not, it says how many more you need.',
    'schemes_partner_s3' => 'If the scheme has a free item, it is added to your order by itself when you reach the minimum. The office arranges any other benefit by hand.',
    'schemes_partner_o1' => 'You can see every running scheme while you order.',
    'schemes_partner_t1' => 'If a scheme is not clear, ask the office before you pay.',
    'schemes_partner_w1' => 'A scheme does not change your order total. Free items earn no commission.',
    'product_facts_badge' => 'Product facts',
    'product_facts_title' => 'Product facts, tags and boxes you can leave empty',
    'product_facts_summary' => 'Write the facts of a product. Leave empty any box you do not need.',
    'product_facts_purpose' => 'What buyers read on a product page of the website is written here. Open “Products” in the “Products & stock” menu and edit the product.',
